      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under aerobic conditions, Zn(ClO4)2·6H2O (0.372 g, 1.00 mmol), Gd(NO3)3·6H2O (0.226 g, 0.5 mmol), and NaO2C-iPr (0.110 g, 1.00 mmol) were dissolved in 50:50 CH2Cl2/MeOH (20 cm3). Hhmp (0.10 cm3, 1.00 mmol) was added; after 5 min stirring, NaOMe (0.108 g, 2.00 mmol) was added and the mixture stirred 20 min. The solution was evaporated to dryness, redissolved in CH2Cl2 (15 cm3), and filtered. MeOH (5 cm3) was added to the filtrate. Vapor diffusion of diethyl ether yielded crystals after ~3 days.",
