        "ph": null,
        "vessel_or_method": "aerobic stirring; evaporation to dryness; filtration; vapor diffusion of Et2O",
        "workup_and_crystallization": "Evaporated to dryness, redissolved in CH2Cl2, filtered to remove NaNO3 and NaClO4; MeOH added; vapor diffusion of diethyl ether.",
