      },
      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Weakly coupled Gd4Zn8 cluster used as the Zn (nonmagnetic TM) reference for magnetocaloric studies. χMT matches four S=7/2 Gd(III) ions; JGdGd = 0.02 cm−1; ground state S=0 with many low-lying states. Large MCE: −ΔSm reaches 7.8 R = 19.4 J kg−1 K−1 at 1.9 K for ΔB = 7–0 T (~93% of the 8.3 R available entropy).",
